# Keep the web image build context lean and deterministic. node_modules is reinstalled inside the
# image (RUN npm install), so it must never be copied in by `COPY . .` — a stray host node_modules
# (or a symlink) otherwise collides with the image's freshly-installed one
# ("cannot replace to directory node_modules with file"). The rest are local/build artifacts the
# image build doesn't need; we deliberately keep source + configs (incl. e2e) so `npm run build`
# (tsc + vite) sees exactly what it does locally.
node_modules
dist
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
*.log
